epoch 3: D=1.48256, G=6.36028, reconstruction L1=0.437764
fixed final=3, real/generated domain accuracy=0.683333/0.333333, mapping MSE=0.202748, test D/G=1.48392/6.36832; single G/3 domains/classifier/roundtrip/restore/immutable PASS (training 0.745573 s)
