> Compare known-map MSE with fitting-only means and an unchanged-source reference

The source diagnostic uses exact retained originals to form the requested known
transform. Its final generator MSE is.2027483411. The next plot compares that
with target-domain means estimated from only300 fitting images per domain and
with returning the unchanged source. These are diagnostic references, not
objectives or extra fitting. All180 known targets are used; row numbers do not
create paired fitting targets. Fitting-only means reach MSE.0678190105 and the unchanged-source reference
.6192136943. Means outperform G on this diagnostic, qualifying claims about
the learned mapping even when target-code changes are measurable.

